WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.599
The queen heard a noise.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.157
"What's that sound?" she asked.

3
00:00:11.158 --> 00:00:14.701
She ran to open the door.

4
00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:18.371
Dirk tumbled into the Royal Bedroom.

5
00:00:18.372 --> 00:00:21.217
He was holding a feather duster.

6
00:00:21.218 --> 00:00:26.582
"Dirk!" cried the queen. "What are you doing?"

7
00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:31.682
Dirk gulped. "I was dusting doors."

8
00:00:31.683 --> 00:00:36.622
The queen frowned. "This isn't dusting day."

9
00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:41.005
Dirk's face turned red. "I was just—"

10
00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:44.095
"Never mind," the king snapped.

11
00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:46.820
"I have a terrible problem.

12
00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:52.170
You must fetch the royal wizard at once!"

13
00:00:52.171 --> 00:00:54.954
"Drat!" Dirk mumbled.

14
00:00:54.955 --> 00:01:01.571
He hurried off.

15
00:01:01.572 --> 00:01:04.447
Tom was in the Royal Kitchen.

16
00:01:04.448 --> 00:01:10.632
He was practicing magic spells.

17
00:01:10.633 --> 00:01:17.226
Dirk ran into the room. "Wizard!" he cried.

18
00:01:17.227 --> 00:01:19.872
He waved his feather duster.

19
00:01:19.873 --> 00:01:26.323
Dust flew everywhere.

20
00:01:26.324 --> 00:01:29.633
"Ah-choo!" Tom sneezed.

21
00:01:29.634 --> 00:01:32.462
"Oh no!" Cook cried.

22
00:01:32.463 --> 00:01:37.574
"Dust is getting in the Royal Soup!"

23
00:01:37.575 --> 00:01:40.965
Tom rushed to help.

24
00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.641
"Don't worry, Cook," he said.

25
00:01:43.642 --> 00:01:46.498
"I'll get rid of all the dust!"

26
00:01:46.499 --> 00:01:50.066
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

27
00:01:50.067 --> 00:01:54.244
Splash! Dirk landed in a tub!

28
00:01:54.245 --> 00:01:56.654
"Oops," Tom whispered.

29
00:01:56.655 --> 00:02:02.163
Cat calmly licked her paws.

30
00:02:02.164 --> 00:02:05.154
Cook pulled Dirk out.

31
00:02:05.155 --> 00:02:09.984
"No dust in the Royal Kitchen!" Cook yelled.

32
00:02:09.985 --> 00:02:15.061
Dirk scowled at Tom. "I'll get you one day, Wizard!

33
00:02:15.062 --> 00:02:17.798
But now you must come with me.

34
00:02:17.799 --> 00:02:23.716
The king and queen need you!"

